---
/**
 * The block: the persistent orange square that carries the one-take.
 * It is born when the intro's orange field contracts, then stays on screen.
 * Later scenes move and reshape it. Hidden unless motion is on.
 */
---

<div class="stage-block" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .stage-block {
    position: fixed;
    z-index: 40;
    right: 1.25rem;
    bottom: 1.25rem;
    width: clamp(2.75rem, 7vmin, 5.5rem);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: var(--color-signal);
    visibility: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .stage-block {
      right: 2rem;
      bottom: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
